# Lesson 7 — functions
#
# A function is a little machine you 'teach' Boxy. You give it a name,
# tell it what it needs ('with'), and what to do. 'give' sends back an answer.

teach square with n {
    give n times n
}

teach greet with name {
    say "hello, ", name, "!"
}

say "5 squared is ", call square with 5
say "9 squared is ", call square with 9

call greet with "Ana"
call greet with "Bea"
